## Visual concept used

A **deep building-services section** rendered in the locked Attractive "Architect's Elevation / Spec Sheet" style — the Skin-track sub-archetype that goes *behind the finished wall* of 1.1 / 2.0. The vertical axis is RISK / INTENSITY (Tier-1 ingestibles at the open floor → clinical at the locked ceiling). The structural hero is a single **BLOODWORK MASTER GATE-VALVE**, drawn closed in the cool slate instrument register, spanning the frame at mid-height and dividing the open, anyone-can-run Tier-1 base (collagen + C, omega-3, niacinamide, antioxidants, D + zinc — the only place real doses appear) from the locked, physician-only upper half. Above the gate the frame splits into two mirrored climbing routes: a warm-terracotta **SYSTEMIC SUPPLY RISER** on the left (isotretinoin → GHK-Cu → GH, sized by risk/reward honesty with GH's "poor risk/reward for skin alone" verdict on its gauge, no doses per house rule) and an **EXTERNAL ENERGY PLANT** on the right (red light → microneedling → peels → lasers → RF/ultrasound). Both routes terminate at the **dermal collagen scaffold** sunk below grade (the 1.1 callback, warm lattice over ghosted hatch = un-manufacturable base). Red is rationed to exactly the **two interlocks** where bypassing a rule does real damage: the isotretinoin × procedure LOCKOUT (a red mechanical bridge from riser to plant) and the laser × Fitzpatrick III–V BURN band (red-edged across the LASERS rung). The slate gate is deliberately *not* red, and the "red light (LLLT)" device is rendered warm/amber — only the two interlocks alarm. Three slate spec docks (the gate / marker hierarchy, procedure cadence, where-to-start order-of-operations) and a bottom route-and-gate strip close it out.

